cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Open Problems Benchmark, please cite it as below. For a problem's best known value, cite its keeper as well: the problem's best_known.provenance names the table, its keeper and the date it was read."
type: software
title: "Open Problems Benchmark (v2.1): open problems with exact checkers"
abstract: "Open problems with an exact checker each: single problems and cells of tables kept by others (covering designs, spherical codes, linear codes, covering arrays, constant weight codes, project scheduling), the Quantavane Prestige 100 and the Quantavane Originals. A submission scores the exact value its checker proves."
version: "v2.1"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
authors:
